{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"geek-engineering","title":"大疆工程师极客文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/geek-engineering","wordCount":2551,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-supremacy","title":"大疆产品至上主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/product-supremacy","wordCount":2806,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"no-ipo-philosophy","title":"大疆低调不上市哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/no-ipo-philosophy","wordCount":3034,"readingTime":13},{"seq":4,"slug":"innovation-at-all-costs","title":"大疆\"偏执创新\"文化：从天空之城到全栈自研的极致追求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/innovation-at-all-costs","wordCount":2236,"readingTime":9},{"seq":5,"slug":"frank-wang-philosophy","title":"汪滔的技术极客理念与管理哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/frank-wang-philosophy","wordCount":2466,"readingTime":10},{"seq":6,"slug":"talent-competition-culture","title":"大疆内部高强度竞争文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/talent-competition-culture","wordCount":2317,"readingTime":10},{"seq":7,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"大疆使命愿景价值观的表述与演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/dji/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":2480,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 文化与价值观 简介\n\n本章深入剖析大疆独特的企业文化体系。大疆的文化基因源自创始人汪滔对技术的极致追求，经过二十年的沉淀与演化，形成了一套在全球科技公司中独树一帜的价值观系统。\n\n**「工程师极客文化」** 解析大疆如何将\"技术至上\"的理念融入组织的每一个毛细血管，从早期\"天才互称\"的极客氛围到成熟期\"以问题解决论英雄\"的工程师文化演变。\n\n**「产品至上主义」** 探讨大疆如何将产品打磨到极致，以Phantom、Mavic等产品线为案例，分析\"不做则已、做则第一\"的产品哲学如何驱动大疆占据全球70%以上的无人机市场份额。\n\n**「低调不上市哲学」** 剖析汪滔坚持不IPO的战略逻辑，以及这一选择如何帮助大疆在面对美国制裁、市场波动等外部冲击时保持技术投入的战略定力。\n\n学习建议：建议结合大疆产品发展史来理解文化形成的背景，关注文化如何从个人驱动演化为组织驱动的过程。\n"}